	"通用": "通用",
	"to start, then use it to stop.": "开始录制，再次按下即可停止。",
	"Run actions automatically when something happens in Cap. Rules are shared with the Cap CLI.": "在应用内发生指定事件时自动执行操作，规则可供命令行工具共用。",
	"One click to add a ready-made automation. Tweak anything afterwards.": "一键添加现成的自动化，之后可随时调整。",
	"Pick a template below to get started in one click, or build your own from scratch.": "选择下方模板快速开始，也可从空白规则创建。",
	"This automation runs commands or sends network requests. Only use values you trust — they execute automatically with your permissions.": "此规则会自动运行命令或发送网络请求，并使用你的权限执行；请仅填写可信内容。",
	"Checks which actions are supported on this device. Does not run the automation.": "检查此设备支持的操作，不会实际运行规则。",
	"This condition never matches for the selected trigger.": "此条件不适用于当前触发事件。",
	"This action has no effect for the selected trigger.": "此操作不适用于当前触发事件。",
	"Install the Cap command for terminals, agents, scripts, and local automation.": "安装命令行工具，供终端、智能体、脚本和本地自动化使用。",
	"The desktop app installs a local": "桌面应用会在本机安装",
	"command that points back to the bundled CLI.": "命令，指向应用内置的命令行工具。",
	"to your PATH. Restart your terminal to use it, or run this now:": "到 PATH 中。请重启终端，或执行以下命令：",
	"Render the camera preview using a native GPU surface instead of through the webview. Experimental and off by default.": "使用原生 GPU 表面渲染摄像头预览。这是实验功能，默认关闭。",
	"Run the fragmented-MP4 muxer in an isolated subprocess so muxer crashes can't take down your recording. Requires the bundled cap-muxer binary.": "在独立进程中封装分段 MP4，降低封装异常对录制的影响；需要应用内置封装工具。",
	"Close this app and reopen the experimental fully-native version of Cap. It is unfinished, so expect missing features. Your recordings and settings are shared, and you can switch back from its Experimental settings.": "原生界面仍处于实验阶段，当前版本暂未提供此入口。",
	"Help us improve Cap by submitting feedback or reporting bugs. We'll get right on it.": "欢迎提交使用建议或问题反馈，帮助我们改进简库镜传。",
	"Have questions, want to share ideas, or just hang out? Join the Cap Discord community.": "社区功能正在准备中，敬请期待。",
	"Runs an audio/video sync test and collects your hardware, displays, cameras, microphones, Cap settings, details of your recent recordings and a copy of Cap's log file, so we can reproduce your setup instead of guessing at it. You can read the whole report before sending it.": "运行音画同步测试，并整理硬件、显示器、摄像头、麦克风、应用设置、近期录制信息和日志，以便排查问题。发送前可阅读完整报告。",
	"The sync test takes over your screen with a flashing pattern and plays loud beeps for about": "同步测试会全屏显示闪烁图案并播放较响的提示音，每条链路约持续",
	"seconds per pipeline. Take your headphones off and leave the volume audible (the microphone test needs to hear the beeps through your speakers), and don't use the machine until it finishes.": "秒。请取下耳机，保持扬声器声音可闻，测试完成前不要操作电脑。",
	"Studio recordings, Instant recordings, or both in one run.": "可测试录制模式、快速录制，或同时测试两种模式。",
	"Also records your microphone and checks it against the beeps it can hear.": "同时录制麦克风，并用收到的提示音检查同步。",
	"The sync test couldn't run:": "无法运行同步测试：",
	". The report still contains your system information.": "。报告中仍包含系统信息。",
	"Upload Cap's log file to help us diagnose issues. It records what the app did, which can include file paths and the names of things you recorded.": "日志可帮助排查问题，其中可能包含文件路径和录制对象的名称。",
	"Automatically restores the notch for new screen and area recordings when the selected region contains the complete notch. External displays, partial areas, and window recordings are left alone. Each recording can override it in the editor.": "当选区包含完整刘海时，为新的屏幕或区域录制还原刘海。外接显示器、不完整选区与窗口录制不受影响，可在编辑器中单独调整。",
	"Cap uses anonymous telemetry to improve reliability and fix bugs. We never collect recording contents, window titles, file paths, or personal information.": "匿名使用数据用于改进可靠性和排查问题，不包含录制内容、窗口标题、文件路径或个人信息。",
	"Switching back to Stable will return you to the latest stable version, which may be older than your current build.": "切回稳定版时，版本可能低于当前测试版。",
	"Only change this if you are running your own instance of Cap Web.": "仅在使用自托管服务时修改。",
	"Click any placeholder to copy it. Time supports custom formats via": "点击占位符即可复制，时间可通过以下格式自定义：",
	"→ \"Studio\", \"Instant\", or \"Screenshot\"": "→ 录制、快速录制或截图",
	"→ \"studio\", \"instant\", or \"screenshot\"": "→ studio、instant 或 screenshot",
	"→ \"Display\", \"Window\", or \"Area\"": "→ 显示器、窗口或选区",
	"→ Monitor name or window title.": "→ 显示器名称或窗口标题。",
	"Recommended Cap windows are not excluded": "尚未排除建议的应用窗口",
	"Camera, settings, or recording windows can appear as black boxes in screen recordings. Missing:": "摄像头、设置或录制窗口可能在捕获中显示为黑块，缺少以下排除项：",
	"Google Drive stores new uploads in a private Cap folder in your Drive. Existing Cap-hosted and S3 videos keep using their current storage.": "云端存储与账号服务正在准备中，敬请期待。",
	"Configure integrations to extend Cap's functionality and connect with third-party services.": "配置第三方集成，扩展应用功能。",
	"It should take under 10 minutes to set up and connect your storage bucket to Cap. View the": "可通过存储配置指南了解连接步骤：",
	"Your Cap plan and desktop license, in one place.": "在此查看账号和服务信息。",
	"Couldn't refresh your plan. Please try again.": "无法刷新方案，请重试。",
	"Already have Cap Pro? Sign in with your account from the sidebar.": "账号服务敬请期待，本地功能可正常使用。",
	"Compare current pricing and everything included on our website.": "账号服务敬请期待。",
	"· Commercial use of the desktop recorder and editor.": "· 桌面录制与编辑。",
	"· A desktop license, plus cloud sharing, AI features and collaboration.": "· 云端分享与协作。",
	"Opens cap.so/pricing in your browser.": "账号服务暂未开放。",
	"720p is included. Cap Pro unlocks 1080p, 1440p and 4K for Instant recordings.": "在线快速录制与账号服务正在准备中，本地录制可选择全部画质。",
	"Add names, spellings, domains, and capitalization preferences that caption generation should keep in mind.": "添加字幕生成时应注意的姓名、拼写、域名和大小写偏好。",
	"Add one term at a time to reduce typos and formatting mistakes.": "每次添加一个词汇，以减少拼写和格式错误。",
	"These hints are applied when you generate captions in the editor.": "在编辑器中生成字幕时应用这些提示。",
	"Please download the latest version manually from cap.so/download. Your data will not be lost.": "暂时无法检查更新，请稍后重试。现有工程不受影响。",
	"If this issue persists, please contact support.": "若问题持续存在，请保留日志以便排查。",
	"Update has been installed. Restart Cap to finish updating.": "更新已安装，请重启简库镜传以完成更新。",
	"Opening pricing in your browser…": "账号服务敬请期待。",
	"Couldn't open your browser. Visit cap.so/pricing to view plans.": "账号服务暂未开放。",
	"Parakeet caption models are unavailable on Intel Macs. Whisper models remain available.": "Intel Mac 暂不支持 Parakeet 字幕模型，可使用 Whisper 模型。",
	"This is the first version of captions in Cap. Active word highlighting may be inaccurate in some situations. We're working on a fix for this and it will be released in upcoming versions.": "字幕中的逐字高亮在部分情况下可能不够准确，仍在持续改进。",
	"Draws a MacBook notch over the recording. Recordings made on a Mac with a notch use their own measurements; otherwise start from the size below and adjust to match.": "在画面上绘制 MacBook 刘海。有刘海的设备使用录制时的尺寸，其他设备可从下方调整。",
	"Segments zoom into different spots. Drag to move them all to the same one.": "所选片段的焦点不同，拖动可将它们统一到同一位置。",
	"Fine-tune source offsets if audio or camera drifts out of sync with the screen recording.": "如果音频或摄像头与屏幕不同步，可微调来源时间偏移。",
	"Cap calculated these offsets automatically to keep audio in sync with the video. Adjust them if anything still sounds off.": "应用已自动计算音画偏移，如仍有不同步可继续微调。",
	"Drag to move · Arrow keys nudge · Hold": "拖动移动 · 方向键微调 · 按住",
	"Tip: Double-click inside the folder to browse the contents.": "提示：双击文件夹可浏览其中的素材。",
	"Tip: Right-click and select \"Show Enclosing Folder\" to see the .cap bundle contents.": "提示：右键选择“显示所在文件夹”可查看工程内容。",
	"Reupload replaces the video at this link with your latest edit. Everyone with the link will see the updated version.": "重新上传会以最新编辑替换现有链接中的视频。",
	"Use Instant Mode for your next recording to record and upload on the fly, with no exporting required.": "在线快速录制正在准备中，可先导出到本地文件。",
	"Drag the image to move it. Pull a corner to resize, or use the rotation handle to turn it. Arrow keys nudge it into place.": "拖动图片可移动，拖动角点可缩放，旋转手柄可旋转，方向键可微调位置。",
	"Drag the image to move it. Drag a corner to resize. Shift temporarily disables snapping.": "拖动图片移动，拖动角点缩放；按住 Shift 可暂时关闭吸附。",
	"Use a Camera Only scene. Padding reveals the background around the camera.": "使用仅摄像头场景，留白会显示摄像头周围的背景。",
	"Styles higher in the timeline take priority. Drag a track handle to change the order. Settings you leave unchanged come from the styles underneath.": "时间线上方的样式优先，可拖动轨道手柄调整顺序；未覆盖的设置继承下方样式。",
	"Pauses the video while the text is shown, then resumes where it left off.": "显示此文字时暂停视频，结束后从原处继续播放。",
	"This screenshot uses a still frame of the animated gradient. Choose another background above to replace it.": "截图使用动态渐变的静态帧，可在上方更换背景。",
